{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"正在面对\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S04-1\",\n      \"text\": \"他怕追着要回应会搅坏眼前的亲近，对方也没答应过他什么。\",\n      \"key\": \"追着要回应\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S04-2\",\n      \"text\": \"他试着把心思放回关心对方、替对方高兴上，不必每次都等对方表示或保证。\",\n      \"key\": \"替对方高兴\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S04-3\",\n      \"text\": \"他暂时不等回应，不怕显得更在乎，给得更满、不计较多少，对对方好本身让他高兴，也更怕这一刻过去。\",\n      \"key\": \"不计较多少\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\", \"B3\", \"B4\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S04-4\",\n      \"text\": \"他怕自己给得太满也会让对方有压力，热情刚放开，又忍不住收回来。\",\n      \"key\": \"给得太满\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\", \"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S04-5\",\n      \"text\": \"他把这阵轻松当成了保证，以为只要不向对方要回应，就能尽情喜欢，也不会失去眼前的亲近。\",\n      \"key\": \"当成了保证\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": []\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S03-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S04-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"限制\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S03-5\",\n      \"to\": \"S04-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S04-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"改写\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-5\",\n      \"to\": \"S04-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"改写\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S04-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R15\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S04-1\", \"S04-4\"],\n      \"what\": \"拆分并补足\",\n      \"why\": \"S04-1保留他想保护眼前亲近、不把未获承诺的期待变成催促。S04-4补出另一层顾虑：即使不索取，给得太满也可能让对方有压力，因此热情刚放开又会收回来，解释情绪为何没有稳稳落定。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R16\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S04-2\"],\n      \"what\": \"具体化\",\n      \"why\": \"把普遍的自我劝诫改成他此刻实际采用的办法：把心思转回关心对方、替对方高兴。用箭头回指S02-2，说明这不是凭空冒出的新领悟，而是把先前自然发生过的自在关心重新用起来。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R17\", \"R18\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S04-3\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"合并更愿意付出、不怕显得更在乎、不计较给多少，避免重复描述投入增加。用对对方好本身让他高兴，替代抽象的丰盈和没来由的满足结果。同时写出回应焦虑暂时退去、心意给得更满后反而怕这一刻过去，让轻松与舍不得并存，而不是把它们排成先后发生的两种心情。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R19\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S04-5\"],\n      \"what\": \"保留并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留他把暂时有效的调整推成保证的过度确信，明确这只是他当时的相信，不是故事认可的事实，为S05仍想知道自己是否被放在心上留下直接前因。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "fe1d5b70-a879-469e-8e17-1f1c9cce1914", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T144450860182Z", "elapsed_seconds": 1627.047, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T15:11:57.926748+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "9c8071c5e2899836f35e4ca090f6dffbc6a900516f409b677d23ab61d32e0fc3", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f45828